<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 6.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 06	Aug 05   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  295.050     293.050     247.020    19.44 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.600     307.940     306.830     0.25 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.015     155.870     158.970    -1.86 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.226	46.194	47.182    -2.03 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  470.260     476.720     419.180    12.19 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.570     138.400     141.685    -2.20 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.954	15.929	16.185    -1.43 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  246.860     247.630     212.430    16.21 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.848	 1.845	1.8880    -2.12 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.542	 1.540	1.5810    -2.47 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.700     191.155     183.135     4.68 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
